===Noun===
{{en-noun|still lifes|still lives}}

# A [[work of art]] [[depict]]ing an [[arrangement]] of [[inanimate]] [[object]]s.
# {{lb|en|cellular automata}} A [[pattern]] that does not change from one [[generation]] to the next.

